# seerdb's ANO request with its checksums narrowed to SHA1 (#2865), stamped
# 0x0B200200: AES-256 and the other ciphers, and SHA1 alone for integrity.
# Captured 2026-11-28 through tools/capture_proxy.py. The ANO container,
# without the packet's header and data flags, as `hexdump -C` output; the
# offset column and the |ascii| gutter are ignored by tests.replay.parse_hexdump.
00000000  de ad be ef 00 93 0b 20  02 00 00 04 00 00 04 00  |....... ........|
00000010  03 00 00 00 00 00 04 00  05 0b 20 02 00 00 08 00  |.......... .....|
00000020  01 00 00 10 1c 66 ec 28  ea 00 12 00 01 de ad be  |.....f.(........|
00000030  ef 00 03 00 00 00 04 00  04 00 01 00 02 00 03 00  |................|
00000040  01 00 03 00 00 00 00 00  04 00 05 0b 20 02 00 00  |............ ...|
00000050  02 00 03 e0 e1 00 02 00  06 fc ff 00 02 00 03 00  |................|
00000060  00 00 00 00 04 00 05 0b  20 02 00 00 09 00 01 00  |........ .......|
00000070  01 08 0a 06 02 0f 10 11  00 01 00 02 01 00 03 00  |................|
00000080  02 00 00 00 00 00 04 00  05 0b 20 02 00 00 02 00  |.......... .....|
00000090  01 00 03                                          |...|
